  "name": "Question 7",
  "problem": "Let $Z=XY.$ What is the value of ${z}_{24}$, if\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{aligned}],\\,Y=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 5 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\n${z}_{24}=$\n{{field-1}}",
